      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "acid"
      ],
      "description": "<p>Caustic saliva drips from the warhound's mouth. Until the end of its turn, the abyssal warhound's jaws Strike deals an additional 2 points of acid damage on a successful attack, or 4 points on a critical success.</p>\n<p>Effect: Caustic Drool</p>",
